      "uid": "zhcn:ed378b6241377b6288b1da3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵，是吧？ 越是奔跑，就越觉得赛事是需要动脑筋的……\n从中我感受到了像桌游一样的乐趣。那时候我非常沉迷于攻略它啊——",
      "source_fingerprint": "d56b240a13f03ceca4172bf19f54f52bf714d8735a31b2a20457724d1af2be19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145002.json",
      "json_path": [
