      "uid": "zhcn:fb5f174a2acab9bac8443ce8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……果然，她拥有着出色的双腿。\n要是让这份才华白白荒废掉，未免也太可惜了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d12231189ffc0333b60ec53d8b6f03da4d7e6819dbc242f02494181c7ace7c46",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
