      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈，选拔赛事吗……你擅自帮我报名的？\n是不是有点太专横了啊，气槽前辈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "543696291b6b5f9a963e242850cbf1fbc259bc5b309c595de71adb23a57cc7db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
