    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dd15cff425a583cab520630",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "要是不做到这种程度，你这家伙根本就不打算去跑吧！\n马上就要入闸了，赶紧去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e7c2d9b8f6e0d17aa751b4105e8cf11954154d0357eec2ec79fd39755df0732",
