      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "统治地位不仅拥有着极高的素质，还具备着罕见的聪慧头脑。\n但是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5fc44c49b0f12cdb4f15f9ce441176954e4b89de8a6eec3e94899222ca949c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
