      "uid": "zhcn:06d40f9eb2dc8796827bdf4e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现在的她已经完全失去了对赛事的动力……这实在是\n太可惜了。到底该怎么做才能让她重新振作起来呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "30024680b4806951e55692e0b58aa32ac63f23216b6a97f913c48995a8b50a21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1145/storytimeline_041145003.json",
      "json_path": [
